:10.237" end="02:11.797"><span begin="02:10.237" end="02:10.457">Oh </span><span begin="02:10.457" end="02:10.877">darling </span><span begin="02:10.877" end="02:11.167">can't </span><span begin="02:11.167" end="02:11.457">you </span><span begin="02:11.457" end="02:11.797">see</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:12.147" end="02:13.787"><span begin="02:12.147" end="02:12.457">I've </span><span begin="02:12.457" end="02:12.877">grown </span><span begin="02:12.877" end="02:13.207">so </span><span begin="02:13.207" end="02:13.457">much </span><span begin="02:13.457" end="02:13.787">more</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:14.017" end="02:15.057"><span begin="02:14.017" end="02:14.277">Maybe </span><span begin="02:14.277" end="02:14.627">maybe </span><span begin="02:14.627" end="02:15.057">maybe</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:15.057" end="02:16.397"><span begin="02:15.057" end="02:15.337">You've </span><span begin="02:15.337" end="02:15.917">forgiven </span><span begin="02:15.917" end="02:16.527">me</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:16.527" end="02:18.277"><span begin="02:16.527" end="02:16.937">Oh </span><span begin="02:16.937" end="02:17.187">but </span><span begin="02:17.187" end="02:17.487">darling </span><span begin="02:17.487" end="02:17.847">darling </span><span begin="02:17.847" end="02:18.277">darling</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:18.277" end="02:19.927"><span begin="02:18.277" end="02:18.537">You </span><span begin="02:18.537" end="02:18.937">have </span><span begin="02:18.937" end="02:19.257">to </span><span begin="02:19.257" end="02:19.667">make </span><span begin="02:19.667" end="02:20.157">sure</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:20.157" end="02:21.647"><span begin="02:20.157" end="02:20.347">To </span><span begin="02:20.347" end="02:20.557">stab </span><span begin="02:20.557" end="02:20.787">me </span><span begin="02:20.787" end="02:20.957">pierce </span><span begin="02:20.957" end="02:21.237">me </span><span begin="02:21.237" end=